            <ArticleTitle>Heterogeneous Catalysis: A Central Science for a Sustainable Future.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>517-521</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1021/acs.accounts.6b00510</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Developing active, selective, and energy efficient heterogeneous catalytic processes is key to a sustainable future because heterogeneous catalysis is at the center of the chemicals and energy industries. The design, testing, and implementation of robust and selective heterogeneous catalytic processes based on insights from fundamental studies could have a tremendous positive impact on the world.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
